Binary Search tree:
----------------------

learn: https://takeuforward.org/binary-search-tree/introduction-to-binary-search-trees/

PreRequisite : Inorder traversal BT, Preorder , Post order, level order traversal in BT

        []N
      /     \
   []L      []R
   L<N<R

eg:,

            [8]
          /     \
        [3]     [10]
     /      \         \
  [1]       [6]         [14]
           /    \       /
        [4]     [7]     [13]

conditions for BST:
----------------
*)Left subtree should be BST
*)Right subtree should be BST
*)L<N<R
*) Ideally no duplicates but if required L<=N<R

why BST:
---------
Generally in BST height is O(logN)